# Skill Definition Template

> Template for generating customer-specific SKILL.md files.

```markdown
# {{SKILL_NAME}}

## Overview
{{SKILL_DESCRIPTION}}

## Prerequisites
{{PREREQUISITES}}

## Commands

{{#each COMMANDS}}
### `{{this.name}}`
{{this.description}}

**Usage:**
```bash
{{this.usage}}
```

**Arguments:**
{{this.arguments}}

**Output:** {{this.output}}
{{/each}}

## Configuration

| Setting | Value | Source |
|---------|-------|--------|
{{#each CONFIG}}
| {{this.name}} | {{this.value}} | {{this.source}} |
{{/each}}

## Used By

| Agent | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
{{#each AGENTS}}
| {{this.name}} | {{this.purpose}} |
{{/each}}
```

## Variable Resolution

| Variable | Source |
|----------|--------|
| `SKILL_NAME` | Contract → skill_name |
| `SKILL_DESCRIPTION` | Contract → Role |
| `PREREQUISITES` | Generated from codebase scan + onboarding answers |
| `COMMANDS` | Contract → Capabilities, resolved to customer's tools |
| `CONFIG` | Onboarding answers → relevant settings |
| `AGENTS` | Contract → Agents Using column |
